However, after months of openly hostile relations and potential catastrophes, when NATO member Turkey hit a Russian combat aircraft, the situation has improved as the two leaders at least have relaunched negotiations.
Scottish Royal Bank will noly no longer be available to customers outside Scots
In the future, SKB will play a support role, the bank's CEO has announced.
Outside Scots, SKB will no longer be available.
Ross Makevan tells the BBC channel in Scots that the SKB brand was associated with the bank's ambitions on a global scale.
It has abandoned these ambitions, because eight years ago the bank almost bankrupt and needed financial assistance.
In the meanwhile, branding strategy experts have used the SKB brand to protect other consumer financial brands.
The bank received millions of pounds from international sports sponsors ranging from Six Disabilities rugby to Wimbledon tennis champion Andy Murray.
However, it has now been decided to bring to the forefront other national brands.
Scottish Royal Banaka will be accessible to Scottish customers, but it will not be initialized.
In England and Welsh, all SKB references, out-of-the-core office and the official stock exchange list, will be changed to NatWest.
The Ulster Bank brand is already being used in the Republic of Ireland and Northern Ireland.
Smaller financial brands such as Coutts, Adam & Co, Drummond, and Holt's Military Bank will now also take no prominence.
Makevan was interviewed during a trip with customers and employees on Inverness.
He teducated the BBC Scottish Canal: "SKB will become a brand of our investors and with which our employees work, as we are now becoming more of brand banking."
Over the course of time, the bank itself became a global-branded and SKB became a global brand.
Now I'm saying that we no longer have global ambitions, we've had local ambitions.
Each of these brands will represent something unique in their industry and our employees will work with customers under these brands.
SKB has already announced that it would not continue sponsoring "Six-Foods" and will involve a variety of brands in sports sponsorship.
"It's the right time to become a brand bank, because we've been asking ourselves for a long time how to become a better bank for our customers?" says the CEO.
Three years ago it would have been very cynical if we announced that we would become an excellent bank for our customers and develop these brands.
However, thanks to hard work and focusing on the needs of our customers rather than our own needs, we've obviously achieved big changes.
We can revive these qualifiers again, that's why I'm thinking it's right now.
Frenny Detori wins the 3000th victory, winning first-three in Newmarket with horse Predilection
