Pike meatballs simple - ground with white bread.
Eat immediately after frying, then they will be the most tasty.
Chicken fillets and white-smother are grind together in a meat grinder.
Add milk, salt, pepper to the mass and grind or mix thoroughly again.
Then the butter kept at room temperature is added to the meatball mass, knead them thoroughly and make meatballs of medium-size.
The meatballs are then wrapped in grumbery.
Pre-coil the oil in a frying pan.
Put the meatballs in a frying pan and fried for 10-15 minutes before a meal until they are golden-brown on both sides.
Serve, while still warm, poured with melted butter or some dressing.
Festival "Kubāna" has begun in Lucavsala.
