Metropolitan Zbigņevs Stankevičs, Metropolitan Archbishop of the Latvian Catholic Church, in an interview with The Independent, emphasizes that if we want to gain the power of life, we need to put the Gospel message at its center.
Because the power of the truth is greater than the darkness of evil.
