I was conducting a festive vigil service the previous day.
Last year I turned to Pope Francis' encyclical "Laudato "Laudato si" and updated the common house captured in it, in the context of the Earth the theme of Latvia.
This year... Of course I'm looking at what's going on in the world, and I'm struggling to respond to it.
