Hebrew film director criticizes hotel in Berlin for disconnecting Israeli long-distance code at the request of an Arab - RT News
Hebrew-born French film director stirred a storm on social media, when he discovered that there is no Israeli long-distation code available at the “Kempinski Bristol” hotel in Berlin. The hotel staff bases it on the request of Arab customers.
