A Russian army plane has been identified near the Latvian border.
A Russian army airplane has been identified in the vicinity of the Latvian border, agency BNS learned from the National Armed Forces.
The NAF informs that patrol airplanes over the neutral waters of the Baltic Sea near the Latvian territorial maritime border on Friday have identified an aircraft "IL-20 of the Russian Armed Forces".
BNS reported on several occasions that Russian armies and naval ships at the borders of Latvia have been detected on a regular basis.
